  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Comparing above equation with general equation of trajectory of projectile <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />And R = 2/9<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math><br />After substituting the value for g and sin 2&theta;. We get <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math> m/s"
